2026-04-12T12:42:25Z","author":{"name":"em-bee","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=em-bee"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738883","title":"Tell HN: docker pull fails in spain due to football cloudflare block","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eI just spent 1h+ debugging why my locally-hosted gitlab runner would fail to create pipelines. The gitlab job output would just display weird TLS errors when trying to pull a docker images. After debugging gitlab and the runner, I realized after a while I could not even run \"docker pull \u003cimage\u003e\" on my machine as root:\u003cp\u003e\u003e error pulling image configuration: download failed after attempts=6: tls: failed to verify certificate: x509: certificate is not valid for any names, but wanted to match docker-images-prod.6aa30f8b08e16409b46e0173d6de2f56.r2.cloudflarestorage.com\u003cp\u003eFirst blaming tailscale, dns configuration and all other stuff. Until I just copied that above URL into my browser on my laptop, and received a website banner:\u003cp\u003e\u003e El acceso a la presente dirección IP ha sido bloqueado en cumplimiento de lo dispuesto en la Sentencia de 18 de diciembre de 2024, dictada por el Juzgado de lo Mercantil nº 6 de Barcelona en el marco del procedimiento ordinario (Materia mercantil art. 249.1.4)-1005/2024-H instado por la Liga Nacional de Fútbol Profesional y por Telefónica Audiovisual Digital, S.L.U.\nhttps://www.laliga.com/noticias/nota-informativa-en-relacion-con-el-bloqueo-de-ips-durante-las-ultimas-jornadas-de-laliga-ea-sports-vinculadas-a-las-practicas-ilegales-de-cloudflare\u003cp\u003eFor those non-spanish speakers: It means there is football match on, and during that time that specific host is blocked. This is just plain madness. I guess that means my gitlab pipelines will not run when football is on. Thank you, Spain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738883\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738883\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 631\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 246\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738883","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738883","date_published":"2026-04-12T12:28:57Z","author":{"name":"littlecranky67","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=littlecranky67"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738827","title":"Bring Back Idiomatic Design","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://essays.johnloeber.com/p/4-bring-back-idiomatic-design\"\u003ehttps://essays.johnloeber.com/p/4-bring-back-idiomatic-design\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738827\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738827\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 432\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 218\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://essays.johnloeber.com/p/4-bring-back-idiomatic-design","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738827","date_published":"2026-04-12T12:21:26Z","author":{"name":"phil294","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=phil294"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738514","title":"Internet outage in Iran reaches 1,008 hours","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://mastodon.social/@netblocks/116384935123261912\"\u003ehttps://mastodon.social/@netblocks/116384935123261912\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738514\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738514\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 146\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 105\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://mastodon.social/@netblocks/116384935123261912","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738514","date_published":"2026-04-12T11:38:16Z","author":{"name":"miadabdi","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=miadabdi"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738343","title":"The Physics of GPS","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://perthirtysix.com/how-does-gps-work\"\u003ehttps://perthirtysix.com/how-does-gps-work\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738343\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738343\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 112\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 30\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://perthirtysix.com/how-does-gps-work","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738343","date_published":"2026-04-12T11:10:18Z","author":{"name":"maouida","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=maouida"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738094","title":"JVM Options Explorer","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://chriswhocodes.com/vm-options-explorer.html\"\u003ehttps://chriswhocodes.com/vm-options-explorer.html\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738094\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738094\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 167\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 71\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://chriswhocodes.com/vm-options-explorer.html","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47738094","date_published":"2026-04-12T10:29:26Z","author":{"name":"0x54MUR41","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=0x54MUR41"}}]}